s man is  an absolute mad lad and a disciple of  lord twego himself and i can't forget  all of our the one tier patrons the ones  who rise above all other clans including  alpha sigma ingrata algital pate heffa  the red haired fox hinokami and water  the toasted chi corey mcgowan spider  left tanel tungsten tarkis big buddhist  and jeremy cummings finally thank you  also to our pro hero tier patrons  including the one and only gilgamesh  steelers angel crews alicia octor bonnie  parks joy and garcia fat boy games kaido  might be a duck jessica rabbit jeremy  phillips and alivania if you enjoy our  videos and you feel that they provide  value for you consider supporting us on  patreon even a single dollar will give  you access to our patreon exclusive  discord and your name will appear in our  videos along with these amazing people  as always thank you guys so much for  watching and until next time see ya  space cowboys  [Music]  you
 

